OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will Benedict's Law mean for
OL,4,Achildren with allergies?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the start of the school year draws
OL,7,Fnear, a new law should ensure
OL,8,Flife-saving allergy pens are held in
OL,9,Fschools across England - to protect
OL,10,Fthose pupils at risk of severe allergic
OL,11,Freactions.
OL,13,FThe measures, which come into effect
OL,14,Ffrom September, will require English
OL,15,Fschools to maintain a stock of
OL,16,Fadrenaline pens in order to limit the
OL,17,Fimpact of a severe allergic reaction on
OL,18,Fschool premises.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
