OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will Benedict's Law mean for
OL,4,Achildren with allergies?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBenedict's Law is named after
OL,7,Ffive-year-old Benedict Blythe, who died
OL,8,Ffrom an anaphylactic reaction to cow's
OL,9,Fmilk at his school in Lincolnshire in
OL,10,F2021.
OL,12,FBristol mum, Beth Hughes, described
OL,13,Fsending her daughter - who has a severe
OL,14,Fdairy and nut allergy - to school as
OL,15,F"anxiety-inducing".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
